  "description": "This receipt is issued by ORLEN and identifies the transaction as taking place at an ORLEN fuel station located on ul. Poznańska 47, 63-040 Nowe Miasto nad Wartą, Poland. The receipt is a Polish fiscal receipt (Paragon Fiskalny) and records the purchase of 26.69 litres of LPG (autogas). The financial section includes the taxable sales amount, 8% Polish VAT (PTU), total VAT collected, and the final amount payable in Polish złoty (PLN). The payment section confirms that the purchase was paid in cash. The receipt also includes transaction identifiers, cashier information, and VITAY Club loyalty program details, including the masked membership number and accumulated points. The overall layout is representative of a Polish fuel station fiscal receipt, combining fuel purchase details, VAT reporting, cash payment, and loyalty program information within a compact receipt format.",
